---
---
<div class="fogg-block">

  <!-- 左栏：模型图示 -->
  <div class="fogg-left">
    <div class="fogg-image-group">
      <img class="fogg-svg hook-model-img" src="/growth-design-site/images/05-structure/hook-model.svg" alt="上瘾模型四象限图：触发、行动、多变奖赏、投入" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <p class="fogg-desc">四个环节循环驱动用户持续回访<br/>形成使用习惯</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 分隔线 -->
  <div class="fogg-divider"></div>

  <!-- 右栏：四维度应用 -->
  <div class="fogg-right">
    <div class="fogg-item">
      <div class="fogg-item-name">触发</div>
      <div class="fogg-item-body">
        <div class="fogg-item-think">下次回访的理由是否到位？</div>
        <div class="fogg-item-logic">在流程中植入下一次行为的诱因</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="fogg-item">
      <div class="fogg-item-name">行动</div>
      <div class="fogg-item-body">
        <div class="fogg-item-think">同单次行为的思考</div>
        <div class="fogg-item-logic">同单次行为的设计逻辑</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="fogg-item">
      <div class="fogg-item-name">多变奖赏</div>
      <div class="fogg-item-body">
        <div class="fogg-item-think">反馈的价值是否具有差异化和惊喜感？</div>
        <div class="fogg-item-logic">加入随机性或阶梯奖励，避免用户对固定反馈产生行为疲劳</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="fogg-item">
      <div class="fogg-item-name">投入</div>
      <div class="fogg-item-body">
        <div class="fogg-item-think">用户是否积累了资产？是否可感知？</div>
        <div class="fogg-item-logic">强化资产累积的逻辑关联，利用损失与逃避确保用户感知到中断成本</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
